---
import ContactButtons from "../components/ContactButtons.astro";
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">About Me</h1>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
            I'm <strong>Farooq Zahid</strong>, a passionate <strong>Flutter developer</strong> 
            and tech enthusiast who loves turning ideas into functional, scalable applications. With a strong background in mobile app development, I specialize in creating intuitive, high-performance applications using 
            <strong>Flutter, Dart</strong>, and modern backend technologies like 
            <strong>Firebase</strong> and <strong>PocketBase</strong>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4">
            I thrive on <strong>solving complex problems</strong>, optimizing workflows, and building seamless user experiences. 
            My portfolio includes projects like <strong>inventory management systems</strong>, <strong>real-time chat applications</strong>, 
            and <strong>rent roll management platforms</strong>, all tailored to solve specific business challenges.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4">
            Beyond development, I'm always exploring new technologies like 
            <strong>Astro</strong> for web development, <strong>Go</strong> for backend services, and 
            even <strong>game development in Godot</strong>. My curiosity fuels my drive to experiment, learn, and innovate continuously.
        </p>

        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mt-4">
            When I'm not coding, I'm sharing knowledge, refining my freelancing skills on platforms like <strong>Upwork</strong>, 
            or brainstorming ways to make technology more accessible and impactful.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 text-gray-900">Let's Connect!</h2>
        <ContactButtons />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
